{
  "COLORFUL_PHILOSOPHERS.pages.INITIAL.options.GAOSHOU.title": "红蓝双色",
  "COLORFUL_PHILOSOPHERS.pages.INITIAL.options.GAOSHOU.description": "获得[blue]{Cards}[/blue]张高手的卡牌。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_SMITE_MASTER.title": "打击大师",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_SMITE_MASTER.pages.INITIAL.description": "刚刚经历了一场战斗，我连续几个打击便击败了怪物。\n随即我便听到远处一位老师傅的声音：「现在的年轻人太不重视打击了！你的打击简直是糟糕透顶！」\n「过来让打击大师教教你什么才是真正的打击！」",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_SMITE_MASTER.pages.INITIAL.options.LEARN_BASIC.title": "学学高水平的打击是什么样子的！",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_SMITE_MASTER.pages.INITIAL.options.LEARN_BASIC.description": "获得1张[gold]打击[/gold]牌，并获得[gold]完美打击[/gold]。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_SMITE_MASTER.pages.INITIAL.options.LEARN_ULTIMATE.title": "大师教教我打击的终极奥义吧！",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_SMITE_MASTER.pages.INITIAL.options.LEARN_ULTIMATE.description": "获得2张[gold]打击[/gold]牌，并获得[gold]无敌打击[/gold]。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_SMITE_MASTER.pages.INITIAL.options.REFUSE.title": "打击什么的不要啊！",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_SMITE_MASTER.pages.INITIAL.options.REFUSE.description": "获得1组卡牌奖励。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_SMITE_MASTER.pages.TAUGHT.description": "「不错不错，这么快你就学会了打击的精髓！」打击大师欣慰地说道。\n「不过可别过几天就把基础的打击忘光了，不然我会很难过的！」",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_SMITE_MASTER.pages.TAUGHT.options.LEAVE.title": "走了！",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_SMITE_MASTER.pages.TAUGHT.options.LEAVE.description": "",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_SMITE_MASTER.pages.DONE.description": "打击大师挥手与我告别。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GUARD_MASTER.title": "格挡达人",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GUARD_MASTER.pages.INITIAL.description": "「格挡最厉害！打击臭大便！」\n我远远的就听到有个大哥一边怒吼一边练习着最基本的格挡。他也注意到了我。\n「来一起练习基础格挡！格挡才是最棒的！」",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GUARD_MASTER.pages.INITIAL.options.TRAIN.title": "那来一起练练！",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GUARD_MASTER.pages.INITIAL.options.TRAIN.description": "升级2张随机的[gold]打击[/gold]或[gold]防御[/gold]牌，并获得1张[gold]防御[/gold]牌。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GUARD_MASTER.pages.INITIAL.options.ASK_TEACH.title": "您这格挡练的有水平啊，教教我！",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GUARD_MASTER.pages.INITIAL.options.ASK_TEACH.description": "获得1张[gold]防御[/gold]牌，并获得[gold]勒紧[/gold]。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GUARD_MASTER.pages.INITIAL.options.MENTION_SMITE.title": "我也曾看不起打击，但是有位老师傅教过我…",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GUARD_MASTER.pages.INITIAL.options.MENTION_SMITE.description": "",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GUARD_MASTER.pages.TRAINED.description": "一起练了一会儿基础格挡，出了一身汗。\n大哥拍拍我的肩膀，让我明天接着来。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GUARD_MASTER.pages.TRAINED.options.LEAVE.title": "走了！",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GUARD_MASTER.pages.TRAINED.options.LEAVE.description": "",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GUARD_MASTER.pages.ENLIGHTENED.description": "我谈起打击大师的打击教学。大哥听完说「原来打击也如此高深...看来打击格挡都十分重要，我悟了！」",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GUARD_MASTER.pages.ENLIGHTENED.options.UNDERSTOOD.title": "我也悟了！",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GUARD_MASTER.pages.ENLIGHTENED.options.UNDERSTOOD.description": "获得[gold]打击格挡奥义[/gold]。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GUARD_MASTER.pages.DONE.description": "我一身汗味地离开了，心里却多了一点新的领悟。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ROADSIDE_BENCH.title": "路边的工作台",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ROADSIDE_BENCH.pages.INITIAL.description": "我看到路边有几个摆在一块的柜子和一个大桌子，上面摆满了改装工具，虽然很基础，但是也足够动手进行一些愉快的改装工作。\n旁边放着一些可以增加伤害效果的尖刺，与增加防御效果的软甲内衬。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ROADSIDE_BENCH.pages.INITIAL.options.SPIKES.title": "加装一些尖刺！",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ROADSIDE_BENCH.pages.INITIAL.options.SPIKES.description": "选择1张[gold]攻击[/gold]牌，为其附上[gold]锋利[/gold]3。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ROADSIDE_BENCH.pages.INITIAL.options.LINING.title": "加装一个软甲内衬！",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ROADSIDE_BENCH.pages.INITIAL.options.LINING.description": "选择1张牌，为其附上[gold]伶俐[/gold]3。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ROADSIDE_BENCH.pages.INITIAL.options.POTION.title": "涂抹一些奇怪药剂！",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ROADSIDE_BENCH.pages.INITIAL.options.POTION.description": "选择1张牌，为其附上[gold]沉眠精华[/gold]1。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ROADSIDE_BENCH.pages.DONE.description": "改装完成后，我收拾好工具，拍了拍手上的灰。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ODD_JOBS.title": "万事屋",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ODD_JOBS.pages.INITIAL.description": "这有个小店铺，处理各类疑难杂务。从占卜算卦，到修鞋补钥匙，都没问题。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ODD_JOBS.pages.INITIAL.options.TRAIN.title": "训练一下！",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ODD_JOBS.pages.INITIAL.options.TRAIN.description": "失去[red]{TrainCost}[/red]金币，升级2张牌。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ODD_JOBS.pages.INITIAL.options.TRAIN_LOCKED.title": "训练一下！（金币不足）",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ODD_JOBS.pages.INITIAL.options.TRAIN_LOCKED.description": "要[red]{TrainCost}[/red]金币，我付不起。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ODD_JOBS.pages.INITIAL.options.WORK.title": "打工一下！",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ODD_JOBS.pages.INITIAL.options.WORK.description": "获得{WorkGold}金币。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ODD_JOBS.pages.INITIAL.options.REST.title": "休息一下！",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ODD_JOBS.pages.INITIAL.options.REST.description": "回复{Heal}点生命。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_ODD_JOBS.pages.DONE.description": "老板冲我挥挥手，说随时欢迎我再来。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_MAGIC_PRODIGY.title": "魔法鬼才",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_MAGIC_PRODIGY.pages.INITIAL.description": "我路过一个小魔法学校，听到里面的教授边吼边轰出一个学生：「你真是个魔法宝才，我们学校捡到鬼了啊！」\n这个学生出来看到了我，赶紧过来推销他的独创法术：「我这个法术太过先进，世人理解不了一点啊！」",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_MAGIC_PRODIGY.pages.INITIAL.options.DRAUPNIR.title": "我学学这个德罗普尼尔",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_MAGIC_PRODIGY.pages.INITIAL.options.DRAUPNIR.description": "获得[gold]德罗普尼尔[/gold]。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_MAGIC_PRODIGY.pages.INITIAL.options.PUNCHING.title": "我学学这个刮痧术",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_MAGIC_PRODIGY.pages.INITIAL.options.PUNCHING.description": "获得[gold]刮痧术[/gold]。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_MAGIC_PRODIGY.pages.INITIAL.options.CRYPTIC.title": "我学学您的魔法思路",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_MAGIC_PRODIGY.pages.INITIAL.options.CRYPTIC.description": "获得[gold]神秘[/gold]。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_MAGIC_PRODIGY.pages.DONE.description": "我收好新学的法术笔记，离开了这所学校。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GRAND_LIBRARY.title": "大书库",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GRAND_LIBRARY.pages.INITIAL.description": "我路过一家好大的图书馆！\n也许可以进去看看有什么好书，或是捐赠一些我不需要的东西。",
  "GAOSHOU_EVENT_GRAND_LIBRARY.pages.INITIAL.options.BORROW.title": "借阅一些书籍！如果有机会一定还。",
